note ARM64 vector matrix block. Each lane retains kvmb's exact row and rounding order.
note vdot4 emits distinct binary64 FMUL/FADD instructions; no FMA or horizontal reduction.
note Opt-in composition replaces only kvmb call sites, keeping scalar source as the oracle.
fn kvmbneon xo ulong xe ulong wi ulong c ulong to void
vdot4 oq oa xo ow wi sub xe xo c
end
